The objective of this tender procedure is to establish a framework contract, per lot, for the provision of proficient, high-quality, geographically clustered transportation car rental services. These services are intended to encompass a range of categories of cars for passenger transportation.  The following categories of vehicles and associated services are to be provided under the prospective framework contract:
• Small transportation cars with a minimum of four seats;
• Transportation cars with a minimum of five seats;
• Minivans.
Frontex intends to establish one framework contract per lot as follows:
Lot 1 - Bulgaria;
Lot 2 - Greece and Cyprus;
Lot 3 - Slovenia, Croatia, Serbia, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Montenegro, North Macedonia, Albania and Kosovo

